    "No protection from malware, administrators, keyloggers, memory inspection, or another process on an unlocked computer",
    "Bulk sealing has no durable journal, crash resume, or idempotent resume into an existing output tree",
    "Bulk sealing reads a live source tree rather than a VSS point-in-time snapshot",
    "The optional mapping report is plaintext and reveals original relative paths and their opaque sealed and recovery names",
